(
    title: "Donkey Kong",
    developer: Some("Garry Kitchen"),
    description: Some("Coleco\'s famous port of the arcade barrel-jumper, squeezed into 4K by Garry Kitchen — who cut two of the four arcade levels to fit and shipped after 72 sleepless hours. What survived is the barrels screen and the rivets screen: climb, hop the rolling barrels, knock the rivets out from under Kong, rescue the girl, repeat faster. Critics grumbled; four million cartridges sold anyway."),
